  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing a Corruption Resilient Governance System in Georgia by Strengthening Institutions and Empowering Civil Society as Actors of Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to Strategic Objective 1 of the Strategic Framework, which is Furthering the development of democracy and human rights; the development and consolidation of democratic societies with respect for human rights, effective tripartite separation of state power and strong independent control bodies, where a politically engaged population, an organized and independent civil society and free media can hold the authorities accountable &#x2013; and ensure inclusive societies with gender equality and recognition of diversity.</narrative>
  </description>
